        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "87c5b672-5806-3579-874b-e46e902bf387",
                "word": "inaltérable",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "a09ad01e-b4b5-47e7-bd67-5aec47859eb9",
                        "entry_id": "87c5b672-5806-3579-874b-e46e902bf387",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "inaltérables"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a3d862c9-9a92-30cb-a297-5a2f9740d12c",
                        "entry_id": "87c5b672-5806-3579-874b-e46e902bf387",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui ne peut être altéré."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "457a0cd3-c54f-4ee9-90a2-09ebef4b148c",
                                "sense_id": "a3d862c9-9a92-30cb-a297-5a2f9740d12c",
                                "text": "Parfois, quand tous ces grotesques tapaient à bras raccourcis sur la République, on voyait ses yeux rire sans que ses lèvres perdissent leur moue d’homme grave. Sa façon recueillie d’écouter, sa complaisance inaltérable lui avaient concilié toutes les sympathies. On le jugeait nul, mais bon enfant."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "18a2a354-f9e2-4a25-b230-3a200c8e36bb",
                                "sense_id": "a3d862c9-9a92-30cb-a297-5a2f9740d12c",
                                "text": "La nouveauté de sa situation expliquait donc son inaltérable patience que le bushman ne pouvait partager."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "06d183c4-f478-428d-b0c2-b91d1309e276",
                                "sense_id": "a3d862c9-9a92-30cb-a297-5a2f9740d12c",
                                "text": "Mais en même temps, ce qui au contraire oriente lentement mais sûrement la législation et les mœurs vers une tolérance et une égalisation grandissantes, c'est précisément cette confiance inaltérable dans ces mêmes valeurs libérales."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fe2c751a-e20d-4bfe-9f24-a8b30abbdc67",
                                "sense_id": "a3d862c9-9a92-30cb-a297-5a2f9740d12c",
                                "text": "La réalité peut être un jeu intellectuel, elle peut acquérir un sens par les méandres de la réflexion mais elle est aussi, ne l’oublions jamais, le simple, lourd, et inévitable poids physique, dur et inaltérable du monde qui nous entoure."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "05ef0af1-27f3-4d29-80c4-08cf6d9595af",
                        "source_entry_id": "87c5b672-5806-3579-874b-e46e902bf387",
                        "source_sense_id": "a3d862c9-9a92-30cb-a297-5a2f9740d12c",
                        "target_lang_word": "unalterable",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unalterable",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "afca2a67-7fa1-39dc-be22-00ce7fa1d292",
                                        "entry_id": "b29a2d7e-223d-3bd4-8602-af09afc04137",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Incapable of being altered, or of changing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3c7ee14d-385b-462f-b8e2-c0acdc6d2f14",
                                                "sense_id": "afca2a67-7fa1-39dc-be22-00ce7fa1d292",
                                                "text": "People of unalterable ideas still insisted upon calling him \"Sergeant\" when they met him, which was in some degree owing to his having still retained the well-shaped moustache of his military days, and the soldierly bearing inseparable from his form."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe8fa906-c136-47f8-a24b-192efe477d87",
                                                "sense_id": "afca2a67-7fa1-39dc-be22-00ce7fa1d292",
                                                "text": "... every statute in the Bible and in the law books is an attempt to defeaat a law of God—in other words an unalterable and indestructible law of nature."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da9ec36f-48dc-4ac4-b534-711aa35ee1bc",
                                                "sense_id": "afca2a67-7fa1-39dc-be22-00ce7fa1d292",
                                                "text": "For instance, we’d need to make one of the following assumptions: (1) that the system will be programmed with an unalterable goal preservation meta-goal, (2) that the training process would select for such a meta-goal, or (3) that the adoption of the meta-goal itself is instrumentally convergent."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a5b82820-35ba-30a2-9def-88b5b4af7751",
                                        "entry_id": "b29a2d7e-223d-3bd4-8602-af09afc04137",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Irreversible, irrevocable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
